// woodcore:object text p1
The following risks are accepted by the owner; they are not part of the design:
// woodcore:/object p1

// woodcore:object text accepted-risks-list
*Accepted risks*:
- *Ground risk* \ Despite ground investigations carried out beforehand, inhomogeneities in the ground that were not known at the time of design may appear during construction. The resulting costs and delays are a risk accepted by the owner.
- *Exceptional events* \ Exceptional events such as terrorism, aircraft crash or impact, explosion or a chemical accident are accepted risks.
- *Explosion* \ [Accepted risk / accidental action.]
- *Vandalism and deliberate damage to the structure* \ Deliberate damage to the structure is not part of the design.
// woodcore:/object accepted-risks-list
// woodcore:/shared accepted-risks
